{
 "description": "List a candidate's platform-wide application history (candidate_dossier.applications.list) by candidate user id \u2014 PLATFORM ADMIN ONLY. Every canonical Joboffer row is returned with PROPOSAL (candidate-submitted) and INVITE (employer-created) counted SEPARATELY and never conflated, plus exact all-row counts (proposals, invites, distinct jobs, distinct organizations, contracts resulted), a proposal timing/velocity summary, rate-integrity bid statuses (INVALID_RATE_DATA reads a null amount), raw outcome flags, and exact offer-linked contract results. Membership, counts, and velocity are frozen at asOf; nextCursor is bound to the candidate and the ORIGINAL asOf so pages never drift or truncate silently. Requires candidate_dossier:read, a claimed account, the default-off candidate-dossier agent surface, AND the named canonical-admin exception \u2014 ordinary employers receive the uniform not-found; candidate self receives a typed SELF_ACCESS_NOT_SUPPORTED denial. structuredContent IS the raw validated page. Never cover letters, contact details, messages, assessments, or private review notes.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "cursor": {
    "description": "Opaque continuation bound to the candidate and the ORIGINAL asOf.",
    "maxLength": 2048,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "limit": {
    "maximum": 100,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "userId": {
    "description": "Candidate user id.",
    "maxLength": 120,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "userId"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
